    "title": "Canton appoints new police chief - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Duncan Dent ,\n23 hours ago The city of Canton has appointed a long-time Madison County resident and former highway patrolman as chief of police. Newly minted Police Chief Eugene Luckett has been on the job for about a week. As the head of the Canton Police Department, Luckett said he wanted to focus on fully staffing the department. Read full article",
